  description:
  - Performing actions and recieving strikes from enemies depletes your stamina.
    You can restore it by eating food or by resting in the town spring.
  - When below 1/4th of max stamina, you may no longer sprint, and any actions the
    player makes will take longer to perform.
  leftText: After gaining access to a Crock Pot, items can be turned into edible
    recipes. Each Crock Pot recipe requires a combination of 4 items, as well as
    oil. After inserting every ingredient, use a torch to start the cooking process.
  rightText: 
